[
  {
    "title": "Systems, Networks & the Internet",
    "tag": "LESSON 23",
    "code": "Chapter 5 · Computer systems and networks",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Systems<br>&amp; Networks</h1><p class=\"zh\">设备 · 网络 · 互联网</p><p class=\"small\">90 minutes · Explain how connected systems communicate</p>",
    "note": "本课从熟悉的输入输出走向设备间的数据交换。不要一开始把互联网、网页、Wi-Fi当作同义词。所有网图是课堂模型。",
    "kind": "dark",
    "time": "0–2 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve data and units",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL",
    "code": "CRD-2.C/D · DAT-1.A",
    "html": "<p>A program sends a message to another program. From each program’s viewpoint, is it input or output?</p><p>How many bits are in 5 bytes?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Output from the sender; input to the receiver. Five bytes contain 40 bits.</div></details>",
    "note": "提取L02相对程序边界的输入输出及L01字节8位，为通信和bit/s单位准备。不要把数据发送方向与物理设备名称混淆。",
    "time": "2–6 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "A useful network explanation",
    "tag": "TARGETS",
    "code": "CSN-1.A/B/D",
    "html": "<ul><li>Name the devices and their shared purpose.</li><li>Show a valid path and the communication rules.</li><li>Separate connectivity, service and capacity.</li></ul><p class=\"small\">Evidence: an annotated model and a short investigation record.</p>",
    "note": "要求解释具体部件关系，避免背词表。最后活动需要网图路径、协议说明与带单位的容量判断，不必配置真实网络。",
    "time": "6–8 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Devices work together as a system",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "CSN-1.A.1/2",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A system combines computing devices and programs for a common purpose.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A system combines computing devices and programs for a common purpose.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Computing device</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">runs a program</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Computing system</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">devices + programs</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Shared purpose</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">one coordinated task</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Example: a sensor, server and display report classroom temperature.</p>",
    "note": "CSN-1.A.1–2。路由器与智能传感器也可运行程序。系统的共同目的与组成不同于“一个盒子”；不要要求每台设备必须有屏幕。",
    "time": "8–12 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "A network connects devices that exchange data",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "CSN-1.A.3–6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 325\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text><circle cx=\"1080\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1080\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">A line is a direct link. A path follows connected devices from sender S to receiver T.</p>",
    "note": "六节点八边合同固定；图无箭头表示双向，不表示边有无限容量。S、T用于解释发送与接收，A到D是抽象中转节点。路径每一步必须有边，不可跨画布凭距离跳转。",
    "time": "12–16 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "The Internet connects networks",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "CSN-1.B.1/2",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The Internet interconnects networks using shared communication protocols.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The Internet interconnects networks using shared communication protocols.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">School network</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">devices + router</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Other networks</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">shared open protocols</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Service network</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">server + devices</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">A local network can function without being connected to the Internet.</p>",
    "note": "互联网是network of networks，不是单个中央计算机。图只示意互连关系，不是实际每次消息必走三段。设备需能连到已连接互联网的设备才获得互联网接入。",
    "time": "16–20 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "A protocol specifies agreed behavior",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "CSN-1.B.3/4/6/7",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Sender and receiver use agreed formats and behavior to communicate.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sender and receiver use agreed formats and behavior to communicate.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Sender</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">uses a message format</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Shared rules</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">meaning + behavior</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Receiver</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">interprets the format</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Open standards support compatible implementations from different creators.</p>",
    "note": "协议不等于物理电缆或网页内容。open表示规则公开且非专有，不意味着任何收费服务必须免费，也不意味着没有管理。共同规则帮助扩展，不保证所有设备自动无需设置兼容。",
    "time": "20–24 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "An IP address helps identify a network destination",
    "tag": "ADDRESSING",
    "code": "CSN-1.B · IP context",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Data and a destination IP address play different roles in delivery.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Data and a destination IP address play different roles in delivery.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Application data</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">what to send</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Destination address</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">where to direct it</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Forwarding</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">toward that address</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">An address is not the message and is not a complete route.</p>",
    "note": "IP地址用于网络接口/目的地址标识，不是永久的人类身份，设备可能有多个地址或地址改变。本课不教学子网掩码、NAT或IPv4/IPv6位数；地址与路径分开理解即可。RFC791支持此补充。",
    "time": "24–28 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "DNS helps resolve a name to address information",
    "tag": "DNS",
    "code": "RFC 1034 · teaching context",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A client obtains address information for a name and then uses that address for communication.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A client obtains address information for a name and then uses that address for communication.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Client</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">asks about a name</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">DNS service</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">returns address data</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Client</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">uses the address</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">DNS is distributed. Its reply does not contain the whole website.</p>",
    "note": "DNS能保存多类记录，本课只用名称到地址的常见查询。可以返回多个地址，不假定一名永久对应一IP。图省略缓存、层次查询与后续连接细节；DNS不是所有流量经过的单台中央机器。",
    "time": "28–32 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "The Web uses the Internet",
    "tag": "COMPARE",
    "code": "CSN-1.D",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The Web is a service using Internet connectivity and HTTP communication.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The Web is a service using Internet connectivity and HTTP communication.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Internet</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">interconnected networks</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Web</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">linked pages and files</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">HTTP</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">Web communication</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Other services also use Internet connectivity, such as Internet mail.</p>",
    "note": "CSN-1.D.1–3。网页是应用层服务，互联网是支撑多种服务的网络基础。HTTP提供Web交互规则；HTTPS安全细节留后章。不能用某网站打不开证明整个互联网不存在。",
    "time": "32–36 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Bandwidth measures capacity per unit time",
    "tag": "WORKED MODEL",
    "code": "CSN-1.A.7/8",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"An ideal eighty-megabit transfer at twenty megabits per second takes four seconds.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"An ideal eighty-megabit transfer at twenty megabits per second takes four seconds.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Payload</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">80 megabits</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Capacity</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">20 megabits/s</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Ideal send time</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">80 ÷ 20 = 4 s</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Ignore overhead here. Route count does not specify bits per second.</p>",
    "note": "带宽是固定时间最大可发送数据量，通常bit/s；本题80与20同一十进制单位可直接相除。容量不等于实际吞吐或总延迟，真实发送受等待、开销等影响。更多路径不能自动推出每秒更多位。",
    "time": "36–40 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Investigation: document the six-node model",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.A",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 325\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text><circle cx=\"1080\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1080\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\"><a href=\"Chapter_5_Network_Lab.html#networks\" target=\"_blank\">Open Networks</a>. Record nodes, links and a possible S-to-T path.</p>",
    "note": "40–44分钟活动1。八条无向边：S-A、S-B、A-C、A-D、B-D、C-T、D-T、C-D。先记录一种自己的路径再求最短；不用穷举所有简单路径。",
    "time": "40–44 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Explain what counts as one hop",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.A.5/6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The given path S-A-C-T uses three links and therefore three hops.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The given path S-A-C-T uses three links and therefore three hops.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S to A</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">one direct link</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A to C</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">one direct link</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C to T</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">one direct link</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Compare S–A–C–T with S–A–C–D–T. Count links, not node labels.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">The paths use 3 and 4 hops respectively.</div></details>",
    "note": "44–48分钟活动2。图中示例为给定路径，可显示；题目比较需学生数出。路径包括起终点四节点却只有三跳，常见误差是节点数当跳数。",
    "time": "44–48 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Predict the selected route before running",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.A.6 · model rule",
    "html": "<p>All links are enabled. The lab selects a shortest-hop path and checks neighbors in alphabetical order.</p><p>Predict the displayed S-to-T route, then run the model.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">S–A–C–T, 3 hops. Other valid 3-hop routes exist; the tie rule makes this result reproducible.</div></details>",
    "note": "48–52分钟活动3。这是BFS课堂选路合同，不是现实互联网强制规则。S先A后B，A发现C、D，C先到T，故预测确定。学生不必写BFS代码，但应区分路径有效与被规则选中。",
    "time": "48–52 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Annotate the communication roles",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 6 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.B/D · DNS context",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"An explanation separates name resolution from delivery and from shared communication rules.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"An explanation separates name resolution from delivery and from shared communication rules.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Name lookup</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">request + address reply</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Data transfer</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">sender + receiver</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Shared protocol</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">format + behavior</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Write one sentence for each role in a fictional page request.</p>",
    "note": "52–58分钟活动4。使用纸面角色解释，不宣称NetworkLab真的执行DNS或HTTP。需要清楚标“DNS解释补充图，网络图模拟路径”。同伴检查有没有把DNS答复当网页或把IP当固定完整路由。",
    "time": "52–58 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Capacity is a different measurement",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 6 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.A.7/8",
    "html": "<p>A payload is 60 megabits. Link capacity is 15 megabits/s. Ignore overhead.</p><p>Calculate the ideal sending time. Can the six-node graph alone verify that capacity?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">60 ÷ 15 = 4 seconds. No; the graph states connectivity, not link capacity.</div></details>",
    "note": "58–64分钟活动5。保留6分钟给计算、单位与论证。不是调用模拟器测带宽，该Lab图无容量参数。学生若直接数3条路说45Mbps，追问是否有并行分流规则及每链路容量，题中都未给。",
    "time": "58–64 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Compare claims with the available evidence",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.A",
    "html": "<ul><li>“S can reach T through connected links.”</li><li>“Every S-to-T route has the same number of hops.”</li><li>“The drawing proves a 100-megabit/s Internet connection.”</li></ul><p class=\"small\">Support or reject each claim using the model.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">First supported. Second false: 3-hop and 4-hop paths exist. Third unsupported: no capacity measurements are given.</div></details>",
    "note": "64–68分钟活动6。让学生指出反例路径和缺失信息，培养证据范围。不能把图中线段物理长度当延迟或带宽。",
    "time": "64–68 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Write the investigation conclusion",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.A/B/D",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A network report explains a route, communication roles and a model limitation.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A network report explains a route, communication roles and a model limitation.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Connectivity</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">path + hop count</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Communication</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">protocol + addressing</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Limit</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">what is not modeled</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Submit the annotated graph and three short evidence-based sentences.</p>",
    "note": "68–72分钟活动7。最少记录一条有效路径、3跳基准路由及一项局限；协议与DNS可以是图旁补充，必须说明模拟器没有实测这些服务。可使用同伴反馈修改一句过度结论。",
    "time": "68–72 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "A service failure is not every network failing",
    "tag": "TRANSFER",
    "code": "CSN-1.B/D",
    "html": "<p>A web page fails to load while an Internet messaging service still works.</p><p>Does that observation prove the device has no Internet connectivity?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">No. A particular service, name lookup or path may have failed while another service still works.</div></details>",
    "note": "迁移理解；不是诊断真实用户网络，只讨论证据不足。不要引入攻击/安全场景。单一网页失败有多种可能，不能据此定位唯一原因。",
    "time": "72–76 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Original check: select TWO",
    "tag": "CHECK",
    "code": "CSN-1.A/B/D",
    "html": "<ul><li>A. The Internet connects networks using open protocols.</li><li>B. A DNS reply is the complete website.</li><li>C. Bandwidth is usually measured in bits per second.</li><li>D. The Web and Internet mean the same system.</li></ul><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">A and C. B confuses name resolution with content; D confuses a service with its underlying network.</div></details>",
    "note": "原创选两项，每个正确判断需用概念解释。若选B，重走DNS请求—地址回复—后续数据三段。",
    "time": "76–80 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Explain a route and a rule",
    "tag": "EXPLAIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.A/B",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 325\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text><circle cx=\"1080\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1080\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Describe the highlighted path, then explain why devices still need a protocol.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">S–B–D–T is a 3-hop path. Connectivity provides a route; a protocol specifies how the communication is formatted and interpreted.</div></details>",
    "note": "选另一条有效路径确认学生没有把基准BFS结果当唯一可能路径。图的高亮是题目给定信息，答案解释仍隐藏。",
    "time": "80–84 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Homework and evidence to keep",
    "tag": "HOMEWORK",
    "code": "Chapter 5",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">12 original questions · 30 teacher marks</p><ul><li>Keep the graph and hop counts.</li><li>Use units in capacity calculations.</li><li>Explain DNS, Web and Internet in distinct roles.</li></ul>",
    "note": "布置作业，保留本课记录供下课数据包路径调用。网页学生作答先隐藏答案，完成后对照教师解释找具体错因。",
    "time": "84–87 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Exit ticket",
    "tag": "EXIT",
    "code": "CSN-1.A/B/D",
    "html": "<p>1. What makes a path valid?<br>2. What does DNS provide in our example?<br>3. Does more route choice prove higher bandwidth?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. Every consecutive pair has a direct link.<br>2. Address information for a name.<br>3. No; route choice alone does not measure capacity.</div></details>",
    "note": "三个点各1分；路径说“看起来连着”需具体每对有边。DNS答复不是内容；带宽必须bit/s而非路线条数。",
    "time": "87–90 min"
  }
]
